stagger_max.description:
The boss's stagger gauge: a main character's smash, a control it resists and a hit on a
part fill it, and a full gauge staggers the boss. 1 to `limits::MAX_STAGGER` (10,000);
`sim_version` 2 only. Absent: no gauge.

offer_size.description:
The base candidates of an offer (ADR-REPL-5): 1 to `rewards::MAX_OFFER_CANDIDATES`.
Deprecated (ADR-CONT-2): absent in a pack of `sim_version` 2, where only 3 is accepted;
read only by the frozen version 1 rules. Absent: 3.

boss_ticks.description:
When a boss comes, in ticks from the start: 1 to `MAX_BOSS_TIMES` times that rise
strictly, inside the length, the last at the length. All but the last are mid-bosses;
the last is the final boss.
